<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Yash Sharma | Digital Marketing Specialist</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --light-bg: #f9f9f9;
      --light-text: #111;
      --dark-bg: #111;
      --dark-text: #f9f9f9;
      --accent: #00bcd4;
    }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background: var(--light-bg);
      color: var(--light-text);
      transition: all 0.4s ease;
    }
    .dark {
      background: var(--dark-bg);
      color: var(--dark-text);
    }
    header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1rem;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: var(--accent);
    }
    p {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 1rem auto;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .links {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 0 1rem;
    }
    button {
      display: block;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border: none;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: gray;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Yash Sharma</h1>
    <p>Digital & Performance Marketing Specialist with ₹1Cr+ ad spend managed and 1000+ campaigns delivered.  
       Expert in Google, Meta, LinkedIn, Amazon & Flipkart Ads, SEO, Website Design, and Canva.</p>
    <div class="links">
      <a href="mailto:yashsharma90116@gmail.com">📧 Email</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yash-sharma-b6a007220">🔗 LinkedIn</a>
    </div>
    <button onclick="toggleTheme()">Toggle Dark/Light Mode</button>
  </header>

  <footer>© 2025 Yash Sharma | All Rights Reserved</footer>

  <script>
    function toggleTheme() {
      document.body.classList.toggle('dark');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
